WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.917
You've failed me.

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:34.250
Not only have you not
brought back the Uranus Queen,

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:36.917
you've actually awakened her.

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:39.458
I am terribly sorry.

00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:42.417
The Beta should be
scrapped now, shouldn't she?

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:44.958
After all of these millennia,

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:47.958
the Downers haven't
been able to even find Synapse.

00:00:47.958 --> 00:00:51.250
We have no need for
an electronic warfare type.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.375
P-Please, wait!
I will get her next time, for sure!

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:59.542
What can someone like you do
against an awakened Uranus Queen?

00:00:59.542 --> 00:01:01.333
No, wait.

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.750
This could be good.

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.208
What are you...

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:25.792
I am dreadfully bored.

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:27.750
Entertain me.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.458
Yes... Master...

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:44.917
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:01:46.208 --> 00:01:48.000
During the Age of Exploration,

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.750
the ship that Columbus
was on faced a certain problem.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.958
The sailors were anxious
over their long voyage,

00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:57.583
and were about to stage a mutiny.

00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:02.250
So then Columbus lied to them,
and recorded distances shorter

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:05.458
than he had actually calculated
into the navigational logs.

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:09.292
The sailors believed them,
and continued the voyage at ease,

00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:11.875
until they discovered the New World.

00:02:11.875 --> 00:02:13.333
--Indeed...
--Indeed...

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.542
it all started with a lie.

00:02:15.542 --> 00:02:20.167
You might call it the "Legend of
the Discovery of the New World."

00:02:20.167 --> 00:02:22.708
Mikako, what are you doing?

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:26.958
I'm your assistant.
You were looking for one, right?

00:02:26.958 --> 00:02:32.125
Ei, you looked so lonesome by
yourself, so I thought I'd help you.

00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:36.083
I'm Pretty 3. Pleased to meet you.

00:02:39.208 --> 00:02:41.708
"The Delusional Story That Began With a Lie"

00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:45.958
Perfect weather for a barbecue, huh?

00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:48.000
Amazing!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.250
Look at all the people!

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.833
Over here.

00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:56.708
I had some of our young men
set aside a place for us.

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:58.333
See? Over there.

00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:00.625
--Don't look at them.
--Hurry along, now.

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:07.083
Say, Tomo, has Nymph
still not come back?

00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:10.958
Yeah. She's probably
gone back up to the sky to visit.

00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:13.458
Sheesh, she comes as she pleases,
and leaves as she pleases.

00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:16.542
--She's such a troublemaker.
--Well, I guess I'll get ready.

00:03:17.583 --> 00:03:20.208
Huh? Where's Ikaros?

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:29.500
Whoa, miss, you can't do that!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:33.125
Hey! Ikaros, what are
you doing, you numbskull?!

00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:38.000
I'm sorry, I'll pay for it for her.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.167
W-What's this?!

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:41.833
<i>Folks, we have a situation! </i>

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:45.792
<i>An unbelievably sexy</i>
<i>and allegedly phantom DVD,</i>

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:48.708
<i>"The Warring States of Boobies:</i>
<i>G-Cup Chaos!"</i>

00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:53.583
<i>Imagine, running into it here!</i>
<i>It can only be called a miracle!</i>

00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:56.667
Um, and this, as well...

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.667
I-I don't have the money!

00:04:03.583 --> 00:04:05.417
Um, Master...

00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.667
I am sorry.

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:18.042
<i>I have to act more human.</i>
<i>More like a "normal" human.</i>

00:04:18.042 --> 00:04:20.958
...you weapon of mass destruction!

00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:27.708
<i>--But how do I act more human?</i>
--I get it. So that's why you said that earlier.

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:30.458
It's only human to lie, you know.

00:04:30.458 --> 00:04:34.458
How awful. You sure had me going.

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:38.042
To lie is human.

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:44.750
Welcome back, Tomo.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.667
Ikaros, the meat is almost done.

00:04:47.667 --> 00:04:50.333
To lie is human.

00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:51.458
Sohara...

00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:52.833
What's up?

00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:54.833
I hate you so much.

00:04:57.417 --> 00:05:02.083
Sohara, nobody finds you to be cute,

00:05:02.083 --> 00:05:05.458
and though you seem kind,
you're very violent.

00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:06.708
W-Wha--

00:05:06.708 --> 00:05:09.875
Plus, there is your slight weight loss.

00:05:09.875 --> 00:05:12.083
Is that wrong?

00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:16.750
Anyway, for those reasons,
Sohara, I hate you.

00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:25.875
There is no New World.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.792
Chairman...

00:05:28.792 --> 00:05:30.208
What?

00:05:32.167 --> 00:05:35.042
You are a very good person.

00:05:35.042 --> 00:05:37.417
Oh my, you're embarrassing me.

00:05:37.417 --> 00:05:42.167
What is this?! That's completely
unlike what you said to me!

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:47.417
I do not wish to stay at your side, Master.

00:05:47.417 --> 00:05:51.042
<i>I do not wish to stay at your side.</i>

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.833
Hey, is this disgusting hooch
all you've got in this place?!

00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:05.583
It must be handy to have a
physiology that gets drunk on cola.

00:06:05.583 --> 00:06:09.667
Well, we're still minors, and all...

00:06:09.667 --> 00:06:12.500
There, there, don't lose your temper.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:18.833
You're fine, Chairman. But me...
but me... Ikaros was mean to me!

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:23.000
Drink some more, and forget everything.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:26.958
Nymph is gone, and Ikaros
says she doesn't want to stick around!

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:28.458
Aw, man...

00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:32.708
Everyone's off doing their own thing!

00:06:32.708 --> 00:06:36.375
Okay, fine! If they're doing
their own thing, then so am I!

00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:40.625
I'm gonna amuse myself to my heart's content!

00:06:41.833 --> 00:06:43.708
Your <i>takoyaki</i>...

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:46.292
...looks very unappetizing.

00:06:46.292 --> 00:06:49.042
Your hair is thick and lush.

00:06:49.042 --> 00:06:52.292
That is an ugly baby.

00:06:52.292 --> 00:06:55.000
<i>I have become more human.</i>

00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:59.125
You're sure enjoying yourself, Alpha.

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:00.958
Nymph...

00:07:02.667 --> 00:07:04.250
What are you doing here?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.667
Before I answer, would you mind
disengaging your Artemis lock on me?

00:07:07.667 --> 00:07:10.625
I'm going to go nuts if
this missile alert in my head

00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:12.833
keeps going off like this.

00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:16.125
I didn't come to reveal who you really are.

00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:20.250
And no matter what I try,
I'm no match for you in combat ability.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.000
It's all right. I just wondered
what happens next in my soaps,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.083
so I thought I would stay
here on Earth a little bit longer.

00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:28.500
Oh.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.375
So, Alpha, you're pretty infatuated

00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:35.000
with your current master, aren't you?

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:40.750
You exist only to crush
the Downers, too. I don't get it.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.542
If you don't want me to
ruin your relationship with him,

00:07:43.542 --> 00:07:47.583
you'll stick with me,
and not say anything funny.

00:07:50.292 --> 00:07:56.208
<i>Hmph, I've got you completely fooled.</i>
<i>I'm here to take you back.</i>

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:59.125
Engage P-Stealth system.

00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:03.708
<i>All I am doing is carrying out my master's orders.</i>

00:08:03.708 --> 00:08:05.917
<i>I'm no match for your strength, </i>

00:08:05.917 --> 00:08:08.500
<i>but I will force you back</i>
<i>to the sky, if I have to.</i>

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.333
<i>In order to do so, first...</i>

00:08:14.792 --> 00:08:19.292
<i>...I'll take your beloved Master, Tomoki, hostage.</i>

00:08:19.292 --> 00:08:20.917
<i>Sorry about this, Alpha.</i>

00:08:20.917 --> 00:08:24.167
You think you've hidden yourself like that?

00:08:24.167 --> 00:08:25.917
I can see you clear as day.

00:08:25.917 --> 00:08:28.000
<i>W-What?!</i>

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.417
<i>How?</i>

00:08:30.708 --> 00:08:33.917
You think you can hide from me?

00:08:33.917 --> 00:08:37.208
I can see everything!

00:08:37.208 --> 00:08:39.958
Yeah, do it! Get it on!

00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:41.583
What are you doing?

00:08:41.583 --> 00:08:44.083
What am I doing? Peeping! I'm peeping!

00:08:44.083 --> 00:08:46.875
Nothing's better than whoopee
to take your mind off things!

00:08:46.875 --> 00:08:49.583
I've got no money, and all.

00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:50.625
Who's there?

00:08:50.625 --> 00:08:52.250
Nymph?!

00:08:54.917 --> 00:08:57.458
What are they doing?

00:08:57.458 --> 00:09:00.417
It looks like the woman
is getting more and more...

00:09:00.417 --> 00:09:04.625
Don't look at that!
Geez, you come back out of nowhere...

00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:06.333
Where have you been all this time?

00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:08.000
It doesn't matter, does it?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:11.708
Yes, it does! If you're going
to leave, say something first!

00:09:11.708 --> 00:09:14.875
Do you know how worried I was about you?!

00:09:14.875 --> 00:09:16.042
Worried...?

00:09:16.042 --> 00:09:19.958
Of course I was! For a houseguest,
you're sure inconsiderate!

00:09:19.958 --> 00:09:23.417
Don't ever disappear
without saying anything again!

00:09:23.417 --> 00:09:24.833
Okay...

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.375
<i>No! No! I came here to take him hostage!</i>

00:09:30.375 --> 00:09:33.042
<i>I can't let Tomoki trip me up!</i>

00:09:33.042 --> 00:09:34.750
All right, then as punishment,

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.875
you have to do what I say
for the rest of the day. Got it?

00:09:38.875 --> 00:09:39.917
Let's go!

00:09:39.917 --> 00:09:41.500
Follow me!

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.208
H-Hold on!

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:49.042
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:09:49.833 --> 00:09:51.958
"Tomoki's"

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.417
What are you doing?

00:09:55.417 --> 00:09:57.667
Huh? Can't you tell by looking?

00:09:57.667 --> 00:10:00.917
A sacrifice sale. This is a sacrifice sale.

00:10:00.917 --> 00:10:04.333
I want that DVD,
but I don't have the money.

00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:06.583
In this situation,
it's time to open my own shop,

00:10:06.583 --> 00:10:11.333
and sell my stuff for tons
of cash! I'm so smart!

00:10:12.292 --> 00:10:14.333
Is this stuff going to sell?

00:10:14.333 --> 00:10:15.917
Like I said,

00:10:15.917 --> 00:10:19.333
I needed some help
from a salesgirl. This is perfect.

00:10:19.333 --> 00:10:21.792
Go over there and round up some customers!

00:10:22.875 --> 00:10:24.542
What are you doing?

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:26.875
Oh, guys...!

00:10:26.875 --> 00:10:28.750
Ah, Nymph!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:34.042
We heard from Ikaros.
You've come back, right? That's great.

00:10:34.042 --> 00:10:35.667
Welcome back.

00:10:36.375 --> 00:10:38.208
Here I am...

00:10:38.208 --> 00:10:42.625
So, a booth, huh? But I doubt
you're going to sell any of this.

00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:44.083
You never know!

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:49.250
Wow, this looks like fun.
I'd like to try running a shop, too.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.625
Ikaros, want to open a shop together?

00:10:53.542 --> 00:10:55.000
Step right up!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:58.708
Try one of Ikaros' delicious box lunches!

00:10:58.708 --> 00:11:03.500
Ikaros, our shop is a big hit!
We make a good combination, huh?

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.250
Yes, Sohara.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:10.750
So anyway, about what you said earlier,
about you hating me...?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.500
Yes, I hate you.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.542
Yeah, I suppose so.

00:11:19.125 --> 00:11:23.333
A Tommy gun, and a Colt 1911.

00:11:23.333 --> 00:11:26.083
All of them are toys, of course.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.708
Damn, they're taking all of my customers--

00:11:31.708 --> 00:11:34.750
with the exception of Sugata.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.625
Nymph, please, you've gotta help me.

00:11:37.625 --> 00:11:40.333
I want that DVD, no matter what it takes!

00:11:40.333 --> 00:11:43.167
It's okay with me.
I'm not doing anything right now.

00:11:43.167 --> 00:11:44.208
Really?

00:11:44.208 --> 00:11:47.375
Once you buy the DVD,
will you let me watch it, too?

00:11:48.625 --> 00:11:50.250
W-Well...

00:11:51.625 --> 00:11:53.833
H-How about, if the shop makes any money,

00:11:53.833 --> 00:11:56.083
I'll buy you whatever
else you want, instead?

00:11:56.083 --> 00:11:58.542
Whatever I want?

00:11:59.083 --> 00:12:03.875
All right. I just have to
help you, right? That's easy.

00:12:03.875 --> 00:12:05.542
Thank you, Nymph!

00:12:05.542 --> 00:12:08.750
I don't think what your
shop is selling is any good.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.625
What if you make it a place that
sells something to eat, like Alpha?

00:12:11.625 --> 00:12:13.208
Like <i>okonomiyaki </i>or something.

00:12:13.208 --> 00:12:16.458
Th-That's it! An <i>okonomiyaki </i>stand!

00:12:18.833 --> 00:12:23.208
Try a specially-made <i>okonomiyaki</i>!
They're cheap and delicious!

00:12:23.208 --> 00:12:26.167
Tomo has started an <i>okonomiyaki </i>stand.

00:12:26.167 --> 00:12:27.750
I think I'll have one.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.375
Okay, thank you!

00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:33.042
So then, what is your preference?

00:12:33.042 --> 00:12:35.542
Here is our menu!

00:12:35.542 --> 00:12:37.750
W-What is this?

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:40.875
For those who want something moderate,
we have the booby stack!

00:12:40.875 --> 00:12:43.875
If you want something more modest,
there's the booby half-helping!

00:12:43.875 --> 00:12:46.542
And for those who have
a deep love of boobies,

00:12:46.542 --> 00:12:49.375
there's the booby E-helping, and F-helping!

00:12:53.792 --> 00:12:57.917
Say, Tomoki, the female
customers are leaving.

00:12:57.917 --> 00:12:59.708
Huh? Oh, crap!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:05.333
Well, what if you had a store that
sold idol goods? Girls like that.

00:13:05.333 --> 00:13:06.833
Oh, that's it!

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.500
Step right up!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:13.208
Get today's featured item!

00:13:13.208 --> 00:13:15.000
A Tomoki pin-up...

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.792
...and a Tomoki fan!

00:13:16.792 --> 00:13:22.083
Act now and I'll throw in these
Tomoki underpants for a mere 200 yen!

00:13:22.292 --> 00:13:25.125
"Tomoki Goods"

00:13:26.958 --> 00:13:29.000
They're not selling!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.875
Just calm down, now...

00:13:31.875 --> 00:13:34.833
<i>At this point, it's time for my last card.</i>

00:13:35.708 --> 00:13:38.333
Hey, mister...

00:13:38.333 --> 00:13:42.125
What do you say, mister?
Panties from a current high-school girl.

00:13:42.125 --> 00:13:43.750
I'll let you have them cheap.

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.125
Buy them now, and I'll include this photo.

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:48.708
Well? Well, mister?

00:13:48.708 --> 00:13:50.167
Tomo...!

00:13:55.333 --> 00:13:58.167
Are you okay, Tomoki?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.750
"Ahh..."

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:09.375
Silly girl.

00:14:12.042 --> 00:14:13.458
Die!

00:14:13.458 --> 00:14:16.667
Damn you all! As much trouble
as I'm having over here!

00:14:16.667 --> 00:14:20.375
Get lost, all of you popular guys!

00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:25.000
This is all the world's fault
for having handsome men!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:28.042
It's because you handsome men are
taking more than your share

00:14:28.042 --> 00:14:33.625
that I am where I am,
trying so desperately, to get that DVD...

00:14:36.958 --> 00:14:39.458
In other words, you want
to be attractive to females?

00:14:39.458 --> 00:14:43.500
Yeah... It's a dream that could
never come true, though.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.833
What am I to do with you?

00:14:52.417 --> 00:14:54.167
Here.

00:14:54.167 --> 00:14:55.875
Hey, what did you do?

00:14:55.875 --> 00:14:59.167
I engaged popular guy jamming.

00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:02.167
Look, it's starting to work.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.500
W-What do you mean?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.875
The upshot is, using my jamming system,

00:15:08.875 --> 00:15:09.083
--I made it so that everyone sees you

00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:10.583
--Unbelievable.
--I made it so that everyone sees you

00:15:10.583 --> 00:15:12.417
--He's the ideal man.
--as the nothing but the ideal man.

00:15:12.417 --> 00:15:14.417
--Ah, I can't hold back anymore!
--as the nothing but the ideal man.

00:15:14.417 --> 00:15:16.708
Please, hold me!

00:15:16.708 --> 00:15:19.375
This is the moment I've been waiting for!

00:15:19.375 --> 00:15:23.083
Now is when I realize my true worth!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:38.000
Thanks for waiting, ladies.
It's your number one...

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.833
Tomoki.

00:15:44.833 --> 00:15:47.083
Welcome, and step right up.

00:15:47.083 --> 00:15:49.042
Tomoki!!

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:53.708
What's a man to do, ladies?
You'll have to get me a drink first.

00:15:53.708 --> 00:15:54.958
I'll get one!

00:15:54.958 --> 00:15:55.792
Me, too!

00:15:55.792 --> 00:15:56.792
Me, too!

00:15:56.792 --> 00:16:00.167
I'll get as many as you want!

00:16:00.167 --> 00:16:03.250
<i>No, no, I went and served his needs!</i>

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.292
<i>I don't have time to be doing this.</i>

00:16:05.292 --> 00:16:10.167
<i>My objective was to take</i>
<i>him hostage. What am I doing?</i>

00:16:10.167 --> 00:16:13.042
Nymph, what are you waiting for?

00:16:13.042 --> 00:16:16.500
Bring us something to drink. Hurry, hurry.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.500
Right!

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.792
Now serving the Dom Perignon.

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:22.792
Now serving a champagne tower.

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:26.542
Now serving a Tomoki tower.

00:16:26.542 --> 00:16:29.833
Huh? What's a Tomoki tower?

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:36.958
It's the moment you've been waiting for.

00:16:36.958 --> 00:16:39.250
Behold my way of life!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:42.083
Now serving... the Tomoki tower!

00:16:46.292 --> 00:16:47.708
Huh?

00:16:49.292 --> 00:16:52.792
My, my, my, what's the matter with all of you?

00:16:52.792 --> 00:16:53.500
Yuck!

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.250
--What a lowlife!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.083
--L-Ladies...?
--What a lowlife!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.542
W-Why?

00:17:02.542 --> 00:17:04.417
I turned off my popular guy jamming.

00:17:04.417 --> 00:17:06.042
Wha--? Hey, you!

00:17:06.042 --> 00:17:08.792
Well, helping out with your
store was keeping me too busy.

00:17:08.792 --> 00:17:10.500
It was starting to become a hassle.

00:17:10.500 --> 00:17:12.417
Aw, man...

00:17:13.667 --> 00:17:19.542
But then, you let me have a good dream,
and I made plenty of money.

00:17:21.792 --> 00:17:24.917
Thank you, Nymph.

00:17:24.917 --> 00:17:27.375
You're thanking me?

00:17:27.375 --> 00:17:31.583
All right, now to go buy that DVD!

00:17:31.583 --> 00:17:34.375
<i>No, no, don't let yourself get tripped up!</i>

00:17:34.375 --> 00:17:39.083
<i>You are an Angeloid.</i>
<i>As long as you have this chain and collar,</i>

00:17:39.083 --> 00:17:42.375
<i>you cannot go against your master.</i>

00:17:45.167 --> 00:17:47.542
Your business is booming.

00:17:47.542 --> 00:17:49.958
Why are you forcing yourself to lie?

00:17:52.458 --> 00:17:55.125
What are you?

00:17:55.125 --> 00:17:58.458
I am human.

00:17:58.458 --> 00:18:01.542
Why has Nymph returned?

00:18:01.542 --> 00:18:04.417
I do not know anything.

00:18:04.417 --> 00:18:08.875
Everything is the exact opposite.
Is there some reason for that?

00:18:08.875 --> 00:18:12.583
Humans are creatures that lie.

00:18:12.583 --> 00:18:15.583
I am a normal human.

00:18:17.042 --> 00:18:18.917
I see now.

00:18:18.917 --> 00:18:22.000
If you keep this up, it will hurt Tomoki.

00:18:26.042 --> 00:18:28.083
Ah, Tomo!

00:18:28.083 --> 00:18:29.917
You're here just in time.

00:18:29.917 --> 00:18:31.417
Huh? What's going on?

00:18:31.417 --> 00:18:35.917
We figured out the real meaning
behind what Ikaros has been saying.

00:18:35.917 --> 00:18:40.583
You snapped at Ikaros earlier
today to be more human, right?

00:18:40.583 --> 00:18:42.875
Yeah, now that you mention it...

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:47.917
In trying to obey what you said,
she has been lying as hard as she can.

00:18:47.917 --> 00:18:49.208
Lying?

00:18:49.208 --> 00:18:51.917
You mean, it was all a lie?

00:18:51.917 --> 00:18:54.792
That means that when you said "I hate you,"

00:18:54.792 --> 00:18:58.000
it really meant "I love you," right?

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.500
Yes.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:03.000
Sohara, anyone who
sees you finds you to be cute,

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:07.625
and though you seem violent,
you are very kind.

00:19:07.625 --> 00:19:12.750
What else did you say?
I've had a slight weight loss... Huh?

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:17.333
Yes, I love how you have
slightly put on some weight.

00:19:17.333 --> 00:19:19.667
Then, there <i>is </i>a New World.

00:19:19.667 --> 00:19:20.792
Yes.

00:19:20.792 --> 00:19:24.333
And I am a good person, right?

00:19:24.333 --> 00:19:28.208
A good person, right?

00:19:28.208 --> 00:19:29.458
Yes...

00:19:29.458 --> 00:19:31.542
Well, there you have it.

00:19:31.542 --> 00:19:34.167
You lied when you said you
didn't want to stay at his side,

00:19:34.167 --> 00:19:37.000
so what you really meant
was that you <i>do </i>want to.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:39.208
Is that right, Ikaros?

00:19:39.208 --> 00:19:40.708
Yes.

00:19:40.708 --> 00:19:43.458
Geez, don't scare me like that.

00:19:43.458 --> 00:19:48.125
I thought I was going to lose you, too.

00:19:48.125 --> 00:19:53.125
Oh, so that's what was going on.

00:19:53.125 --> 00:19:55.458
Things have changed quite a bit, huh?

00:19:55.458 --> 00:19:57.875
At first, you hated it, didn't you?

00:19:57.875 --> 00:20:01.000
When Ikaros showed up,
then Nymph showed up.

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:03.792
Even now, I can't stand all the trouble.

00:20:03.792 --> 00:20:05.167
Nothing beats peace and quiet.

00:20:05.167 --> 00:20:06.792
Come on and admit it already.

00:20:06.792 --> 00:20:10.625
Assuming you really do
want anything to change.

00:20:16.917 --> 00:20:22.625
Master, I am sorry about today.
I did not mean to cause any trouble.

00:20:22.625 --> 00:20:25.000
It's okay. I've gotten used to it.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:30.708
Yes... Um, is it okay if I ask you a question?

00:20:30.708 --> 00:20:34.750
Today, when I decided to
lie about my feelings,

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.875
and I thought about what
my feelings really were,

00:20:37.875 --> 00:20:45.375
I began to wonder,
what does Master think about me?

00:20:48.875 --> 00:20:53.042
Back when I was a child,
I wasn't a normal kid.

00:20:53.042 --> 00:20:55.500
I had something of an
overactive sense of adventure,

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:58.625
a lot like Sugata, in a sense.

00:20:58.625 --> 00:21:02.000
I would go into the mountains,
and if I found something unusual,

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.917
I would bring the others in my class there.

00:21:04.917 --> 00:21:07.458
But there were times
when things got dangerous,

00:21:07.458 --> 00:21:10.833
and once in a while, my friends got hurt.

00:21:10.833 --> 00:21:15.292
At some point, they all stopped
coming into the mountains with me.

00:21:15.292 --> 00:21:19.000
I think with some of them,
their parents told them to stop, and such,

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.458
but all of a sudden, I was all alone.

00:21:25.417 --> 00:21:30.958
So when I think about you and
Nymph suddenly leaving me, too,

00:21:30.958 --> 00:21:33.958
it kind of reminds me of back then...

00:21:49.458 --> 00:21:52.792
I want to remain at your side, Master.

00:21:52.792 --> 00:21:55.250
From now on, and forever.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.917
W-W-W--

00:21:57.917 --> 00:22:00.583
What are you doing?!

00:22:01.083 --> 00:22:05.292
Ikaros, I'm trying to have a
serious discussion with you,

00:22:05.292 --> 00:22:08.667
--and you have no idea what it means!

00:22:08.667 --> 00:22:12.667
--Things on Earth are the same as ever.
--and you have no idea what it means!

00:22:22.292 --> 00:22:30.000
<i>The early summer rains were green</i>

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:37.542
<i>Being alone in the</i>
<i>afternoon left me forlorn</i>

00:22:37.542 --> 00:22:45.167
<i>Falling in love, I've been stoking</i>

00:22:45.167 --> 00:22:53.250
<i>these lonesome, unrequited feelings</i>

00:22:54.500 --> 00:23:02.125
<i>Unable to say "I love you," first love</i>

00:23:02.125 --> 00:23:08.958
<i>turns your heart</i>
<i>into a swinging pendulum</i>

00:23:08.958 --> 00:23:16.583
<i>You ran across the</i>
<i>schoolyard after class</i>

00:23:16.583 --> 00:23:25.042
<i>From a distance,</i>
<i>I was always looking for you</i>

00:23:25.042 --> 00:23:34.875
<i>It's a twilight dream,</i>
<i>so it lingers in my heart</i>

00:23:48.792 --> 00:23:54.458
"The Warring States of Boobies...
A battle between the breasts."

00:23:54.458 --> 00:23:56.375
They're fighting each other!

00:23:56.375 --> 00:23:59.083
Do you have any idea what time it is?

00:24:00.333 --> 00:24:03.083
Don't watch that on your own!

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:08.086
Next time,
"Where the Melodious Words Of an Angel Go"
